Electron adaptation notes (42-x-y):
WebContentsImpl::MoveWindowTo()/ResizeWindowTo() do not exist on this
branch, so those two hunks were dropped. The branch already carried a
weak-frame guard in ViewSource() (from an earlier backport) at the old
call site; it was removed in favour of the upstream block at its new,
earlier position. Browser test conflicts (includes and new tests) were
taken from upstream.

